eepp libpng import, updated 2026-10-25

Upstream: https://github.com/pnggroup/libpng
Release: v1.6.59
Source archive: https://codeload.github.com/pnggroup/libpng/tar.gz/refs/tags/v1.6.59

The library C sources, headers and architecture implementations are unchanged
from v1.6.59. pnglibconf.h is scripts/pnglibconf.h.prebuilt from that release.
Demo programs other than the previously included pngtest.c are not imported.
The old local math.h portability edit in pngpriv.h is obsolete upstream.
.clang-format preserves vendor formatting and preprocessor continuations.

Includes the ARM Neon palette-expansion fix for CVE-2026-33636 and the later
1.6.x security fixes. The existing Premake recursive source glob includes
new architecture implementations; no build-system source list is duplicated.
